hints.pseudocode:
atMost(limit): left = 0; total = 0; freq = empty map
  for right in 0 .. n - 1:
    add numbers[right] to freq
    while freq has more than limit different values: remove numbers[left] from freq; left += 1
    total += right - left + 1       (all subarrays ending at right with at most limit values)
return atMost(k) - atMost(k - 1)
